{"type":"text","text":"**Subject:** Harbor Hall confirmed for March 12 — contract review by Friday\n\nHi Dana,\n\nHope you’re having a good week. I have good news on the venue.\n\nAfter some phone tag, I reached Priya yesterday. Harbor Hall confirmed us for **March 12**—the date we originally wanted. Here are the details:\n\n- **Walkthrough:** March 3. Let me know if that day doesn’t work for you.\n- **Final cost:** $4,200, slightly under what we planned. They waived the AV setup fee since we’re bringing our own projector.\n- **Capacity:** Up to 85 guests, which is in line with our current RSVP count. We should be fine unless we get a significant number of late sign-ups.\n\nThey also sent a contract draft. I’ve read through it and nothing stood out as unusual, but I’d like you to review it before I sign. Please let me know by Friday if you have any concerns; otherwise, I’ll sign and return it that day.\n\nHappy to talk it through if that’s easier.\n\nThanks,\nSam"}
